WEBVTT

00:00:01.751 --> 00:00:04.671
Why are we forced to work?!

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:07.921
Why must we pay money in order to eat?!

00:00:07.921 --> 00:00:10.051
Can't we all just share?

00:00:10.051 --> 00:00:13.261
The rich get fat while the poor die!

00:00:13.641 --> 00:00:16.641
Where is the true freedom in this world?!

00:00:16.641 --> 00:00:19.311
We are all slaves to our work!

00:00:19.311 --> 00:00:21.101
And is work fun?

00:00:21.601 --> 00:00:23.941
No! How could it be?!

00:00:23.941 --> 00:00:26.941
We do not want to work, period!

00:00:26.941 --> 00:00:30.611
That's why I, Hammerhead, will change our society

00:00:30.611 --> 00:00:34.701
into one where only those who want to work will work, supporting those who don't!

00:00:35.161 --> 00:00:37.581
We will create a utopia!

00:00:37.581 --> 00:00:41.371
The Paradisers, led by me, Hammerhead, will make all this a reality!

00:00:46.581 --> 00:00:48.381
Boss, no one's listening.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:49.591
What?!

00:00:50.001 --> 00:00:52.591
Bah! They're all mindless damn sheep!

00:00:52.591 --> 00:00:54.011
Let's go!

00:00:54.011 --> 00:00:57.601
Zeniru's the richest man in town. We'll wreck his posh penthouse

00:00:57.601 --> 00:00:59.891
and show them we're serious!

00:00:59.891 --> 00:01:02.771
High-rise apartments are symbols of inequality!

00:01:02.771 --> 00:01:04.141
Yes, sir!

00:01:14.321 --> 00:01:18.071
ONE PUNCH

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:23.531
THREE, TWO, ONE, KILL SHOT

00:01:23.531 --> 00:01:27.291
JOIN THE FIGHT, CERTAIN VICTORY, THE STRONGEST EVER

00:01:23.531 --> 00:01:27.291
SANJOU, HISSHOU, SHIJOU SAIKYOU

00:01:27.291 --> 00:01:29.291
WHAT WAS THAT? FRUSTRATION

00:01:27.291 --> 00:01:29.291
NAN DATTEN DA? FRUSTRATION

00:01:29.291 --> 00:01:30.791
THERE'S NO STOPPING ME

00:01:29.291 --> 00:01:30.791
ORE WA TOMARANAI

00:01:30.791 --> 00:01:34.921
ONE PUNCH, IT'S OVER, VICTORY AFTER VICTORY

00:01:30.791 --> 00:01:34.921
ONE PUNCH, KANRYOU, RENSENRENSHOU

00:01:34.921 --> 00:01:38.551
I WIN, I ALWAYS WIN, OVERWHELMINGLY

00:01:34.921 --> 00:01:38.551
ORE WA KATSU, TSUNE NI KATSU, ASSHOU

00:01:38.551 --> 00:01:42.391
POWER, GET POWER

00:01:42.391 --> 00:01:45.351
RIGHT TO THE VERY LIMIT

00:01:42.391 --> 00:01:45.351
GIRIGIRI GENKAI MADE

00:01:45.351 --> 00:01:46.561
HERO

00:01:46.561 --> 00:01:49.731
PEOPLE SHOWER ME WITH PRAISE

00:01:46.561 --> 00:01:49.731
ORE O TATAERU KOE YA

00:01:49.731 --> 00:01:52.771
BUT I DON'T DO THIS FOR THE FAME

00:01:49.731 --> 00:01:52.771
KASSAI NANTE HOSHIKU WA NAI SA

00:01:52.771 --> 00:01:54.021
HERO

00:01:54.021 --> 00:01:58.781
SO I JUST FIGHT EVIL IN SECRET

00:01:54.021 --> 00:01:58.781
DAKARA HITOSHIREZU AKU TO TATAKAU

00:01:58.781 --> 00:02:00.241
(NOBODY KNOWS WHO HE IS)

00:02:00.241 --> 00:02:04.411
COUNTLESS ENEMIES FILL THE SKY

00:02:00.241 --> 00:02:04.411
SORA OOI OSHIYOSERU TEKI

00:02:04.411 --> 00:02:07.491
BUT I WON'T TURN MY BACK AND FLEE

00:02:04.411 --> 00:02:07.491
ORE WA SE WO MUKE WA SHINAI

00:02:07.491 --> 00:02:08.831
HERO

00:02:08.831 --> 00:02:13.831
I'VE MADE UP MY MIND AND I WON'T GIVE IN

00:02:08.831 --> 00:02:13.831
NARABA YURUGINAKI KAKUGO SHITA TAME

00:02:13.831 --> 00:02:21.051
A FIGHTING HERO

00:02:13.831 --> 00:02:21.051
TATAKAU HERO

00:02:21.051 --> 00:02:27.601
A SOLITARY HERO

00:02:21.051 --> 00:02:27.601
KODOKU NA HERO

00:02:27.601 --> 00:02:32.601
I WANNA BE THE STRONGEST HERO

00:02:27.601 --> 00:02:32.601
I WANNA BE A SAIKYOU HERO

00:02:39.531 --> 00:02:42.661
This whole building is Zeniru's home.

00:02:43.991 --> 00:02:46.871
There's no way he made so much money legally.

00:02:47.241 --> 00:02:49.331
Unforgivable! Bring it down!

00:02:49.331 --> 00:02:50.041
Yes, sir!

00:03:04.181 --> 00:03:05.931
Target destroyed!

00:03:06.931 --> 00:03:10.351
These experimental battle suits sure pack a wallop.

00:03:10.351 --> 00:03:14.651
It was totally worth risking our lives to steal them.

00:03:14.651 --> 00:03:16.981
Wait, that was the wrong building.

00:03:18.151 --> 00:03:19.571
My bad, Boss.

00:03:19.571 --> 00:03:21.781
Zeniru's house is a little further up.

00:03:23.161 --> 00:03:25.491
Everyone makes mistakes!

00:03:25.491 --> 00:03:28.911
The important thing is to
learn from them. Am I right?

00:03:29.201 --> 00:03:30.161
Absolutely, sir!

00:03:30.161 --> 00:03:33.041
All right, then onward to Zeniru's!

00:03:46.591 --> 00:03:49.221
Thanks, bicycle guy!

00:04:10.871 --> 00:04:14.961
Don't come asking to play rock-paper-scissors with a booger on your finger!

00:04:18.841 --> 00:04:19.711
A dream?

00:04:21.091 --> 00:04:25.381
The terrorist group responsible for the destruction
call themselves the "Paradisers."

00:04:25.381 --> 00:04:27.931
They have destroyed a high-rise building in City F.

00:04:27.931 --> 00:04:30.721
The situation seems to be spiraling out of control.

00:04:31.101 --> 00:04:34.731
We have just learned the identity of their leader.

00:04:34.731 --> 00:04:40.731
B-class Criminal Hammerhead

00:04:35.311 --> 00:04:37.981
Hammerhead is a B-class criminal

00:04:37.981 --> 00:04:40.731
who has been involved in several violent incidents in the past.

00:04:41.571 --> 00:04:43.941
He is a man of large stature,

00:04:43.941 --> 00:04:46.491
standing 2.15 meters tall
and weighing 210 kilos.

00:04:46.491 --> 00:04:52.991
According to one report, he once fought 20 men
in a street brawl and sent them all to the hospital.

00:04:53.911 --> 00:04:57.791
The Paradisers sent the following statement to this TV station.

00:04:57.791 --> 00:04:59.131
"We will continue our rampage

00:04:59.131 --> 00:05:03.381
until food, clothing, and shelter are provided free of charge to those who do not work,"

00:05:03.381 --> 00:05:05.171
Sounds pretty boring.

00:05:03.381 --> 00:05:06.091
amongst other nonsensical demands.

00:05:06.091 --> 00:05:12.681
Like Hammerhead, the group is made up of unemployed young men with no motivation to work.

00:05:08.971 --> 00:05:11.261
No need for me to get involved.

00:05:12.681 --> 00:05:16.351
In addition, the group members
all have bald heads,

00:05:16.351 --> 00:05:18.481
making them quite intimidating.

00:05:19.401 --> 00:05:22.571
Anyone who encounters any
bald-headed men on the street

00:05:22.571 --> 00:05:24.991
is advised to leave the area immediately.

00:05:25.691 --> 00:05:27.491
Wh-What?

00:05:28.451 --> 00:05:28.991
But that's—

00:05:29.281 --> 00:05:29.861
They stole

00:05:30.281 --> 00:05:31.991
my look!

00:05:32.451 --> 00:05:33.871
I spend all this time trying to be a hero,

00:05:34.451 --> 00:05:38.001
but if this goes on, I'll be treated like a villain!

00:05:39.541 --> 00:05:41.381
I'm gonna smash them!

00:05:42.791 --> 00:05:43.671
Run!

00:05:43.671 --> 00:05:44.211
It's them!

00:05:44.211 --> 00:05:46.421
The Paradisers are coming!

00:05:47.341 --> 00:05:50.051
They… aren't backing down!

00:05:52.601 --> 00:05:54.221
This is too dangerous!

00:05:56.721 --> 00:05:58.601
Stop right there, you pack of thugs!

00:06:10.991 --> 00:06:14.491
The righteous cyclist, Mumen Rider, is here!

00:06:14.491 --> 00:06:16.741
Mumen Rider has come to save us!

00:06:16.741 --> 00:06:18.201
There's nothing to fear if he's here!

00:06:20.291 --> 00:06:22.081
A hero? What a joke!

00:06:22.921 --> 00:06:23.711
Here I go!

00:06:26.961 --> 00:06:29.381
Somebody call an ambulance!

00:06:30.421 --> 00:06:32.261
Mr. Zeniru, you must flee!

00:06:33.721 --> 00:06:39.181
Running away from terrorists would hurt my reputation.

00:06:39.181 --> 00:06:40.981
There's no need to leave.

00:06:43.401 --> 00:06:45.361
You're a lucky man.

00:06:45.361 --> 00:06:49.401
Just be glad I'm still under contract.

00:06:50.531 --> 00:06:52.491
But you're a bodyguard—

00:06:52.491 --> 00:06:53.661
Oh, Sonic!

00:06:54.121 --> 00:06:56.041
Can I leave this to you?

00:06:56.451 --> 00:06:57.701
Those guys are—

00:06:58.621 --> 00:06:59.871
Of course.

00:07:00.751 --> 00:07:03.121
It's their lives you should worry about.

00:07:03.121 --> 00:07:07.711
Please do think of a way to
dispose of the pile of corpses.

00:07:09.011 --> 00:07:10.261
The Paradisers…

00:07:10.261 --> 00:07:14.471
A bunch of upstarts equipped with
some new type of battle suit.

00:07:14.971 --> 00:07:17.811
And the B-class criminal Hammerhead.

00:07:17.811 --> 00:07:20.431
He might have some backbone.

00:07:20.431 --> 00:07:24.941
THE MODERN NINJA

00:07:26.941 --> 00:07:31.781
Boss, you can see Zeniru's building across the woods.

00:07:31.781 --> 00:07:34.661
People call it the Golden Turd.

00:07:36.411 --> 00:07:37.701
All right, let's go!

00:07:45.881 --> 00:07:47.331
We've got company.

00:07:48.751 --> 00:07:50.971
I've been waiting for you, Hammerhead.

00:07:52.761 --> 00:07:54.641
Zeniru sent me.

00:07:57.301 --> 00:07:59.011
Let me start by saying

00:07:59.561 --> 00:08:04.021
no opponent of mine has ever escaped alive.

00:08:04.021 --> 00:08:05.691
I plan on keeping it that way.

00:08:05.691 --> 00:08:08.811
When it comes to my work, I'm a perfectionist.

00:08:08.811 --> 00:08:12.241
But if you surrender right now, I'll let you live.

00:08:13.111 --> 00:08:15.151
So, what will it be?

00:08:45.231 --> 00:08:46.311
What is this?

00:08:49.611 --> 00:08:51.191
What's going on?

00:08:51.191 --> 00:08:51.981
Why is every—

00:08:56.781 --> 00:08:58.571
Holy crap!

00:09:00.701 --> 00:09:03.121
Bastard!

00:09:10.211 --> 00:09:13.341
What's this now? Trying to intimidate me?

00:09:13.961 --> 00:09:16.181
You can't see me, can you?

00:09:17.051 --> 00:09:18.891
There you are!

00:09:23.181 --> 00:09:24.471
It's a terrorist!

00:09:24.471 --> 00:09:25.771
I'm not one of them!

00:09:32.151 --> 00:09:34.691
So he decided to fight rather than flee.

00:09:43.871 --> 00:09:46.961
Oops, there goes my bad habit again.

00:09:48.501 --> 00:09:50.961
You're just a little dog bought by Zeniru's money.

00:09:50.961 --> 00:09:57.091
You think a freedom fighter like me
can lose to a hired dog like you?!

00:09:57.091 --> 00:09:59.881
I see what he's up to.

00:09:59.881 --> 00:10:02.101
Just as I thought—he's a complete fool.

00:10:02.101 --> 00:10:06.101
Couldn't he have at least tried to
arrange the rocks in a less obvious way?

00:10:08.521 --> 00:10:10.771
There are plenty more rocks where those came from!

00:10:11.351 --> 00:10:15.231
If you don't stop me, they'll keep coming!

00:10:15.231 --> 00:10:20.531
So you think you'll be able to deal with my speed if you know which direction I'm coming from?

00:10:21.031 --> 00:10:23.531
How pathetic. But I'll play along.

00:10:23.821 --> 00:10:25.041
In fact,

00:10:25.041 --> 00:10:26.491
I'll take you…

00:10:27.121 --> 00:10:28.001
straight on!

00:10:34.671 --> 00:10:36.671
He's too fast. I can't see him.

00:10:36.671 --> 00:10:38.551
But that doesn't matter…

00:10:38.551 --> 00:10:39.721
if I do this!

00:10:42.681 --> 00:10:43.851
Gotcha!

00:10:46.391 --> 00:10:50.811
Reflect on how stupid you were to
challenge me on your way down to Hell!

00:10:55.561 --> 00:10:56.941
It's over.

00:10:56.941 --> 00:10:59.611
Unfortunately, I couldn't go easy on them.

00:11:00.611 --> 00:11:04.071
Yes, Hammerhead's body is here too.

00:11:04.071 --> 00:11:05.411
I'll head back now—

00:11:07.531 --> 00:11:09.201
The body disappeared?

00:11:12.921 --> 00:11:14.711
That was close!

00:11:14.711 --> 00:11:17.421
Good thing he hit my head.

00:11:17.421 --> 00:11:22.221
My skull's always been thicker than the average human's.

00:11:22.221 --> 00:11:26.351
Dammit! I don't know who that son of a bitch was,
but one day I'm gonna kill—

00:11:26.351 --> 00:11:26.851
Huh?

00:11:27.431 --> 00:11:29.471
Now what?

00:11:37.861 --> 00:11:39.271
Oh, there you are.

00:11:52.541 --> 00:11:54.081
As with the mosquito monster,

00:11:54.711 --> 00:11:59.051
I once again underestimated my opponent's power.

00:11:59.591 --> 00:12:03.171
I let my guard down,
and Kabuto took advantage of that.

00:12:03.171 --> 00:12:05.921
If Master Saitama had not been there,

00:12:06.591 --> 00:12:08.891
I would have certainly been destroyed.

00:12:09.551 --> 00:12:10.431
I see.

00:12:10.891 --> 00:12:12.641
Well, I'm glad you're okay.

00:12:12.641 --> 00:12:13.971
Doctor…

00:12:13.971 --> 00:12:16.691
Master Saitama saved my life twice.

00:12:17.561 --> 00:12:20.401
You, Doctor Kuseno, restored my life to me.

00:12:20.401 --> 00:12:23.201
Later, Master Saitama saved that same life,

00:12:23.201 --> 00:12:25.401
and now he has saved it again.

00:12:26.361 --> 00:12:28.701
Yes, I get the picture, Genos.

00:12:29.531 --> 00:12:34.501
Basically, you're trying to tell me how amazing this Saitama fellow is, right?

00:12:34.501 --> 00:12:35.461
Yes.

00:12:36.001 --> 00:12:39.171
Genos, they're not ready just yet,

00:12:39.171 --> 00:12:42.461
but I'm developing a new series of augmentations.

00:12:42.461 --> 00:12:47.471
When I replace your existing parts with these
new ones, you may be able to surpass this Saitama.

00:12:48.801 --> 00:12:54.641
I imagine he must possess an enormous amount of
strength for you to go on about him like this.

00:12:56.601 --> 00:12:57.231
Yes.

00:12:58.311 --> 00:12:59.771
What's your deal?

00:12:59.771 --> 00:13:01.981
You here to sign up with the Paradisers?

00:13:01.981 --> 00:13:02.481
No, no.

00:13:03.361 --> 00:13:05.781
I'm just a guy who's a hero for fun.

00:13:06.241 --> 00:13:09.241
For personal reasons,
I'm here to smash your heads in.

00:13:10.321 --> 00:13:12.201
So, where are your followers?

00:13:12.201 --> 00:13:14.161
Then, die!

00:13:21.291 --> 00:13:23.751
I better get out of here quick.

00:13:25.551 --> 00:13:27.381
H-Huh?!

00:13:27.381 --> 00:13:29.221
I thought I punched him…

00:13:29.881 --> 00:13:31.761
What a letdown.

00:13:31.761 --> 00:13:34.891
Those battle suits had me all excited.

00:13:35.391 --> 00:13:38.931
But they look lame, and all they do is give you superhuman strength.

00:13:42.601 --> 00:13:46.531
You have no idea how hard it was
to get ahold of these things!

00:13:46.531 --> 00:13:50.621
How could you know what they're worth?!

00:13:52.911 --> 00:13:58.661
I've been looking for someone to
test this suit's full power on!

00:14:06.421 --> 00:14:09.341
Spin Attack!

00:14:10.221 --> 00:14:14.101
I used to use that move
all the time when I was a kid.

00:14:17.261 --> 00:14:19.641
No way…

00:14:21.601 --> 00:14:25.441
Hammerhead, huh? He's a lot like me.

00:14:25.901 --> 00:14:28.951
What the hell are you?!

00:14:37.411 --> 00:14:42.421
W-Wait! I just wanted to get out of working!

00:14:45.251 --> 00:14:47.001
Don't be bad anymore, okay?

00:14:47.001 --> 00:14:50.301
Huh? So you're not going to kill me?

00:14:50.301 --> 00:14:50.961
Get outta here.

00:14:50.961 --> 00:14:52.181
Y-Yes, sir!

00:14:59.811 --> 00:15:01.851
Guess I'll head home.

00:15:03.981 --> 00:15:06.271
Where did Hammerhead go?

00:15:09.021 --> 00:15:11.071
There's no one left but you.

00:15:20.081 --> 00:15:22.921
Hammerhead went that way. Butt naked.

00:15:26.961 --> 00:15:28.091
What's this?

00:15:34.221 --> 00:15:35.551
Hey, you've got it wrong.

00:15:37.221 --> 00:15:38.681
I've got what wrong?

00:15:39.561 --> 00:15:41.941
I'm not one of the Paradisers.

00:15:43.141 --> 00:15:44.311
You're lying.

00:15:44.601 --> 00:15:45.771
No, no, no.

00:15:45.771 --> 00:15:47.941
Don't be dumb! Look at me!

00:15:47.941 --> 00:15:48.941
I don't need to.

00:15:49.611 --> 00:15:52.231
That bald head is all the proof I need.

00:15:52.821 --> 00:15:53.361
No…

00:15:53.781 --> 00:15:55.571
Look! It's me! Me!

00:15:55.571 --> 00:15:57.821
You know, the guy who's a hero for fun—

00:15:57.821 --> 00:15:58.831
Never heard of you.

00:16:03.581 --> 00:16:05.211
Oh, I see…

00:16:05.211 --> 00:16:08.051
Either way, it doesn't matter.

00:16:08.961 --> 00:16:13.801
You've read my attacks twice now.
That's the real problem.

00:16:14.261 --> 00:16:16.221
I was born in a ninja village,

00:16:16.221 --> 00:16:19.551
and I've been perfecting my techniques since childhood.

00:16:20.891 --> 00:16:26.101
Yet you saw right through them.
This I cannot allow.

00:16:27.231 --> 00:16:28.851
What's he talking about?

00:16:30.061 --> 00:16:32.441
My pride won't have it.

00:16:32.441 --> 00:16:36.661
I don't care who you are,
but I can't just let you walk away.

00:16:37.491 --> 00:16:38.951
Oh, come on.

00:16:39.821 --> 00:16:42.701
You just want to try out your moves on me.

00:16:43.241 --> 00:16:45.541
I can tell by that innocent smile of yours.

00:16:54.341 --> 00:16:57.801
What do you think of this supersonic speed?

00:16:57.801 --> 00:16:59.551
Of these shock waves?

00:17:00.391 --> 00:17:01.561
Can you even see me?

00:17:05.601 --> 00:17:08.061
How can you possibly keep up with me?

00:17:10.231 --> 00:17:11.021
Hey…

00:17:13.521 --> 00:17:14.781
Can I go home now?

00:17:16.031 --> 00:17:17.491
Bastard!

00:17:17.491 --> 00:17:19.241
Wind Blade Kick!

00:17:23.161 --> 00:17:24.871
Checkmate.

00:17:27.701 --> 00:17:29.581
Sorry!

00:17:29.581 --> 00:17:31.831
That wasn't on purpose.

00:17:31.831 --> 00:17:35.421
I meant to stop just in time,
but your momentum made my fist hit your…

00:17:38.181 --> 00:17:42.681
We are experiencing technical difficulties.

00:17:38.181 --> 00:17:42.681
Please stand by.

00:17:43.301 --> 00:17:48.351
I've worked every job from assassin
to bodyguard. No ninja is more deadly.

00:17:48.351 --> 00:17:49.691
I am Speed-o'-Sound Sonic!

00:17:50.141 --> 00:17:52.561
But I'm putting my work on hold.

00:17:52.561 --> 00:17:55.071
Now that I've found such a formidable opponent,

00:17:55.071 --> 00:17:57.941
I will dedicate myself to training
until we settle this.

00:17:59.321 --> 00:18:00.901
Tell me your name.

00:18:01.571 --> 00:18:02.661
It's Saitama.

00:18:03.241 --> 00:18:04.621
Saitama!

00:18:04.621 --> 00:18:07.451
Next time we meet, it'll be your demise!

00:18:10.211 --> 00:18:11.211
Okay.

00:18:11.501 --> 00:18:14.421
I, Speed-o'-Sound Sonic, the ultimate ninja,

00:18:14.421 --> 00:18:16.471
will bring you down without fail!

00:18:17.381 --> 00:18:18.341
Train hard!

00:18:21.381 --> 00:18:23.101
Speed-o'-Sound Sonic?

00:18:23.101 --> 00:18:24.431
Who is that?

00:18:24.431 --> 00:18:27.181
And who would possess such a redundant name?

00:18:27.511 --> 00:18:28.721
Dunno.

00:18:28.721 --> 00:18:32.061
He suddenly appeared,
declared we were rivals, and took off.

00:18:32.061 --> 00:18:34.731
If he is a nuisance, I will get rid of him.

00:18:34.731 --> 00:18:36.191
Well, you're hardly different.

00:18:36.191 --> 00:18:43.951
Good things come

00:18:36.191 --> 00:18:43.951
to those who wait

00:18:36.571 --> 00:18:38.611
Actually, why are you here again?

00:18:38.611 --> 00:18:40.441
Go home! It's not like we're related!

00:18:40.441 --> 00:18:42.821
Master, I must become stronger—

00:18:42.821 --> 00:18:43.951
Shut up!

00:18:45.621 --> 00:18:50.451
I've learned of a serious problem,
and it's left me reeling from shock.

00:18:50.451 --> 00:18:52.831
So I beg you, go home for today.

00:18:52.831 --> 00:18:54.421
A serious problem?

00:18:54.961 --> 00:18:58.511
What could cause a problem
for someone as great as you?

00:18:58.511 --> 00:18:59.471
Please share with me.

00:19:07.641 --> 00:19:09.231
No one knows who I am.

00:19:11.981 --> 00:19:15.441
It's been three years since I first became a hero.

00:19:16.191 --> 00:19:20.941
I've defeated tons of monsters and
evil organizations since then.

00:19:20.941 --> 00:19:25.411
I've never heard of any other heroes doing as much as me.

00:19:25.411 --> 00:19:28.751
Everyone in the world should know me by now!

00:19:28.751 --> 00:19:32.251
Isn't it weird that I don't have any fans or anything?!

00:19:32.911 --> 00:19:35.501
You know what he said to me today?

00:19:35.921 --> 00:19:38.761
"Never heard of you."

00:19:38.761 --> 00:19:43.131
Plus, everyone in town took me for a terrorist.

00:19:43.131 --> 00:19:46.761
They've all forgotten how I beat
those monsters for them!

00:19:47.591 --> 00:19:48.761
He is right.

00:19:48.761 --> 00:19:51.351
The news report did not mention

00:19:51.971 --> 00:19:54.901
Master Saitama or Speed-o'-Sound Sonic.

00:19:55.561 --> 00:19:59.901
Instead, the credit for defeating the Paradisers went to a hero called Mumen Rider.

00:20:00.731 --> 00:20:01.571
Wait…

00:20:02.321 --> 00:20:02.821
Master!

