I had no idea.

00:20:45.571 --> 00:20:47.451
Genos, are you registered?

00:20:47.821 --> 00:20:49.701
No. I feel no need to.

00:20:52.491 --> 00:20:53.871
Let's register!

00:20:53.871 --> 00:20:56.791
Register with me, and I'll make you my apprentice.

00:20:57.331 --> 00:20:58.791
Let's go!

00:21:03.751 --> 00:21:07.301
P-Please… F-Forgive me…

00:21:09.261 --> 00:21:13.311
First he steals battle suits from the organization,
and then he pleads for his life?

00:21:13.311 --> 00:21:15.061
He has truly understood nothing.

00:21:15.601 --> 00:21:20.901
Of course, we did let the theft take place
in order to collect field data of the suits in action.

00:21:21.561 --> 00:21:22.151
And the body?

00:21:22.811 --> 00:21:23.771
Leave it.

00:21:25.781 --> 00:21:30.241
Thanks for giving me my thick skull, Mommy.

00:21:30.241 --> 00:21:32.041
I promise I'll get a job!

00:21:32.041 --> 00:21:38.541
