00:21:32.531 --> 00:21:38.541
Our guest today is Mr. Majimeda, an expert on
the labor issues confronting young people today.

00:21:38.961 --> 00:21:40.421
Thank you for having me.

00:21:40.421 --> 00:21:42.831
As we saw with the Paradiser incident recently,

00:21:42.831 --> 00:21:46.761
there's been an increase in youth
lacking any motivation to work.

00:21:46.761 --> 00:21:48.681
Can you comment on this phenomenon?

00:21:49.131 --> 00:21:51.131
Even in the case of the Paradisers,

00:21:49.801 --> 00:21:52.681
I'm not so different…

00:21:51.131 --> 00:21:54.181
